# Explicit Access Modifiers

Always write the access modifier on methods, fields, and properties — do not rely on the default `private`:

- Unity lifecycle: `private void Awake()`, `private void Update()`
- Helpers: `private void SetCursorLocked(bool locked)`
- Public API: `public void SetControlEnabled(bool enabled)`
- Fields: `private PlayerMover _mover`, `[SerializeField] private float _walkSpeed`
- Properties: `public int CollectedCount => _collectedCount`, `private bool _isEnabled { get; set; }`

```csharp
// BAD
void Update()
{
}

[SerializeField] float walkSpeed;
int CollectedCount => _collectedCount;

// GOOD
private void Update()
{
}

[SerializeField] private float _walkSpeed;
public int CollectedCount => _collectedCount;
```
